1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,170
For 11 years,

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,470
I said a career break
isn't a red flag.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,842
Then I took one.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,257
But coming back was
harder than leaving.

5
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:09,636
My experience still fit.

6
00:00:09,666 --> 00:00:12,132
One gap was real,
so I worked on it.

7
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,410
A pause isn't a full stop.

